# Cloudflare Pages custom headers
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# This app is a static, client-only SPA — no server the app itself
# controls — that talks directly to Supabase for auth and data, plus
# Google Fonts and data: URIs for user-uploaded logos. The CSP below is
# scoped to exactly that. Tighten/loosen only if you actually add a new
# external dependency (a new API, an embed, an analytics script, etc.).
#
# connect-src includes https://*.supabase.co: without it, every
# supabase-js call (auth, the /admin CMS's posts queries, everything in
# src/lib/supabase.ts) is silently blocked by the browser at the network
# layer — the request never leaves the page. This is *required*, not
# optional hardening, for anything using Supabase to actually work.
#
# Optional — only if you enable Cloudflare Turnstile on the admin login
# form (VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY, see src/admin/lib/turnstile.ts): add
# " https://challenges.cloudflare.com" to script-src, and add a
# "frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com;" directive. Left out by
# default so the CSP stays as tight as possible until you actually turn
# Turnstile on.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), interest-cohort=(), accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), display-capture=(), midi=(), screen-wake-lock=(), xr-spatial-tracking=(), clipboard-write=(), fullscreen=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-XSS-Protection: 0
  X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none
  X-DNS-Prefetch-Control: off
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
